# profile: openai
# @tier: 1
# @summary: OpenAI directly, Responses API, text-embedding-3-small for embeddings.
# @key: OPENAI_API_KEY in .env
# @cost: pay per token; see the prices in config/pricing/models.yaml
# @dotnet: yes (the .NET stack always uses Chat Completions and ignores LLM_API)
# @verified: client wiring by stubbed-transport tests only. No recorded or live run in this repo has used
#   api.openai.com. gpt-5.1 here is unmeasured: prompts and evals were tuned on gpt-4.1.
# @evals: live quality and safety suites through the eval CLI, capability check, cost; replay gate not applicable
# @judge: not the model under test, so a different provider. Suggestion only, not calibrated (D-7, M3).
# @judge-env: JUDGE_PROVIDER=azure JUDGE_MODEL=gpt-5.1
LLM_PROVIDER=openai
LLM_MODEL=gpt-5.1
LLM_BASE_URL=
LLM_API=responses
LLM_TEMPERATURE=
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=
EMBEDDING_BASE_URL=
EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
EMBEDDING_DIM=1536
